DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250416
SUMMARY:North Dakota: 58 (partnership) / 60 (S-corp) due
DESCRIPTION:North Dakota partnership return due the 15th day of the 4th mon
 th after year-end. | North Dakota partnership return due the 15th day of th
 e 4th month after year-end. A federal extension is automatically accepted f
 or North Dakota purposes\; a standalone North Dakota extension (Form 101) i
 s not automatic and requires demonstrating good cause. | Authority: North D
 akota Office of State Tax Commissioner\, direct fetch this session of the c
 urrent 2025 instructions: "The 2025 Form 58 must be filed on or before... A
 pril 15\, 2026\, if filing for the 2025 calendar year"\; "If an extension o
 f time to file the federal partnership return is obtained\, it is automatic
 ally accepted as an extension of time to file Form 58"\; a standalone ND ex
 tension (Form 101) "is not an automatic extension - there must be good caus
 e." | Source: https://www.tax.nd.gov/sites/www/files/documents/forms/softwa
 re-developer/partnership-forms/2025-partnership-income-tax-instructions.pdf
  | This date is computed from a recurrence rule and may not reflect a later
 -announced change\; confirm against the cited source before relying on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
